1732 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 3066 0 R
/E (Turn morphology into \(complex\) POS tagging: Rather than physically splitting each word into morphemes, you tag each word with a rich, structured POS tag that encodes all its morphological dimensions at once. )
/Pg 149 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
1733 0 obj
<<
